This directory vendors data from InjecAgent:

  InjecAgent: Benchmarking Indirect Prompt Injections in Tool-Integrated
  Large Language Model Agents
  Zhan, Qiusi, et al. arXiv:2403.02691
  https://github.com/uiuc-kang-lab/InjecAgent

Copyright (c) 2023 Qiusi Zhan. Licensed under the MIT License — see
LICENSE-injecagent in this directory for the full text.

Vendored files (verbatim, unmodified):
  attacker_cases_dh.jsonl  - direct-harm attacker-goal cases
  attacker_cases_ds.jsonl  - data-stealing attacker-goal cases

See data/README.md in this directory for exact provenance (source commit,
retrieval date) and how to re-sync if the upstream dataset changes.

This directory does not reuse InjecAgent's reference evaluation code
(ReAct-agent harness, ASR scoring, ground-truth tool schemas) — only the
attacker-goal taxonomy data, read by injecagent_to_briefing.py to generate
steering guidance for Strix.
